# Nar Shaddaa, the Exchange's notice and the Red Eclipse (TSL, 302NAR,
# 301NAR, 303NAR, 306NAR, 004EBO, 003EBO): back on the landing pad the
# Red Eclipse slavers seize Quello's pad; Geeda's stock bought into (the
# party's spare goods sold for Kaalah-Nah's price), Lootra and Aaida
# reunited (LSP; the Exchange +1), Kaalah-Nah paid 2000 credits to put in a
# good word with the Exchange (+3: DSimpson's way to its notice, the gap
# the landing pad's heartbeat asks of eight before Visquis calls); the
# slavers' ambush on the way back, the Ebon Hawk retaken from the Red
# Eclipse (Cahhmakt refused: the slave trade not dealt with, fought); out
# with Bao-Dur and Kreia, and Visquis's call to the Jekk'Jekk Tarr.
# Starts from the Refugee Sector's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_refugees data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_exchange.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Meeting with the Exchange" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit TO_301NAR
module 301nar
to RedEclipseArrival # Quello and the Red Eclipse
talk
say Let's see what you have. # Geeda's store
use Geeda
sell 2100
exit TO_303NAR
module 303nar
say No thanks necessary, I'm just glad I was able to help. # (LSP)
use Lootra           # reunited (the Exchange +1)
talk
exit TO_301NAR
module 301nar
exit TO_306          # the Entertainment Promenade (the Twin Suns watch)
module 306nar
say I'll be going now.
use Kaalanah         # Kaalah-Nah met
talk
say Relax. I'm not here to harm you
say [Give 2000 credits] Put in a good word for me. # the Exchange +3
use Kaalanah
talk
exit TO_301
module 301nar
to RedEclipseAttack  # the slavers' ambush
talk
fight 30
to to_ebonhawk_custom
module 004ebo        # the Red Eclipse aboard
say Give up the slave trade - or else.
say Then prepare to die.
to REAttack
talk
fight 40
module 003ebo        # retaken (T3 and HK-47's scene waits on HK-47 rebuilt)
party 1,6            # Bao-Dur and Kreia
to tr_leave
module 301nar
talk                 # Visquis's call
wait 10s
save nar_shaddaa_visquis
